OL,4,CHope for millions as cheaper HIV       
OL,5,Cprevention jab reaches Africa          
OL,6,GUganda is set to receive its first     
OL,7,Gsupplies of a cheaper version of a     
OL,8,Gground-breaking injection to prevent   
OL,9,GHIV, raising hopes of expanding access 
OL,10,Gto the drug across Africa, where the   
OL,11,Gburden of the disease remains highest. 
OL,13,FThe first global shipment of the       
OL,14,Fgeneric drug, known as lenacapavir,    
OL,15,Farrived in Zambia on Wednesday, with   
OL,16,Fdeliveries to Uganda expected in the   
OL,17,Fcoming days, the Global Fund has said. 
